# Sync API Rules

- Offline commands MUST be persisted locally before upload.
- Every sync operation MUST have a stable operation_id.
- Retry MUST not create duplicate server effects.
- Sync conflicts MUST be represented explicitly in UI/state.
- Server timestamps and server state take precedence over client timestamps/state.
- Batch synchronization MUST tolerate partial success.
